WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:02.549
Apple just announced the new iPad Pro, and
to be honest following the rumors beforehand

00:00:02.549 --> 00:00:04.480
this was the device I was least excited about.

00:00:04.480 --> 00:00:09.030
During the announcement though, as soon as
they revealed it and especially when they

00:00:09.030 --> 00:00:13.040
talked about specs my jaw kept dropping more
and more.

00:00:13.040 --> 00:00:17.720
After the event was over, the new iPad Pro’s
are what I’m most excited about, and yes

00:00:17.720 --> 00:00:20.570
we are getting one in so make sure you click
that subscribed button to see some great content

00:00:20.570 --> 00:00:24.250
on it, and while you’re down there don’t
forget to hit that bell icon.

00:00:24.250 --> 00:00:28.920
Now even though its the biggest update to
the iPad ever, and that A12X bionic processor

00:00:28.920 --> 00:00:35.260
is ridiculously powerful, beating out even
the most expensive 15” 2017 Macbook Pro,

00:00:35.260 --> 00:00:37.140
its not all rainbows and sunshine.

00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:40.260
Here are 5 top problems with the iPad Pro.

00:00:40.260 --> 00:00:41.929
is going to be the price.

00:00:41.929 --> 00:00:44.440
The 11 inch costs $150 more then before, and
the 12.9” $200 more.

00:00:44.440 --> 00:00:53.329
Apple charging more per device, and those
that just bought it will have a tough time

00:00:53.329 --> 00:00:54.329
upgrading.

00:00:54.329 --> 00:00:57.890
In fact just yeterday they annoucned they
won’t reveal sales figures.

00:00:57.890 --> 00:01:04.790
You have to buy the new Apple Pencil.

00:01:04.790 --> 00:01:05.790
$129.

00:01:05.790 --> 00:01:18.510
New one is great, this is how it 
should be from the start.

00:01:18.510 --> 00:01:19.510
RAM.

00:01:19.510 --> 00:01:29.570
Only in the $1550 11inch and $1750 12.9”
Device that will replace your PC, with super

00:01:29.570 --> 00:01:32.520
powerful apps like Photoshop and Lightroom.

00:01:32.520 --> 00:01:33.540
Video editing etc.

00:01:33.540 --> 00:01:34.900
OnePlus 6 has 8GB.

00:01:34.900 --> 00:01:35.920
No headphone jack.

00:01:35.920 --> 00:01:37.860
What about DJ’s that they showed off.

00:01:37.860 --> 00:01:40.880
There is enough space, this is a pro device.

00:01:40.880 --> 00:01:45.910
When will they take it out of the Macbooks.

00:01:45.910 --> 00:01:51.260
Now we’re not certain yet, but most likely
they won’t include an adapter either.

00:01:51.260 --> 00:01:52.260
Keyboard.

00:01:52.260 --> 00:02:16.499
Not only does it cost more, but you can no
longer fold it back to have a slim standing

00:02:16.499 --> 00:02:22.359
profile which is really useful when you have
limited space.

00:02:22.359 --> 00:02:26.609
The new keyboard case which covers the back
does allow for two viewing angles, but the

00:02:26.609 --> 00:02:35.739
keyboard sticks out more now than it did before
taking up a lot more room so those of you

00:02:35.739 --> 00:02:42.420
who loved this layout that was possible with
both the smart and smart keyboard, its no

00:02:42.420 --> 00:02:43.420
longer available.

00:02:43.420 --> 00:02:56.749
Thankfully if you don’t need the keyboard,
you

00:02:56.749 --> 00:03:22.310
can buy the smart folio for way less and 
you can have that setup, and it also covers

00:03:22.310 --> 00:03:40.709
the front and back, and gets rid of the camera
bump, but unfortunately, it's now only available

00:03:40.709 --> 00:03:45.239
in soft plastic instead of premium leather
with a $10 higher price.

00:03:45.239 --> 00:03:46.239
Camera.

00:03:46.239 --> 00:03:47.889
Smart HDR, Nice Quality, But no OIS.

00:03:47.889 --> 00:03:51.980
Really helpful for lowlight and videos, doing
AR.

00:03:51.980 --> 00:04:11.909
If we’re already going to have a substatial
camera bump that won’t allow this otherwise

00:04:11.909 --> 00:04:29.479
boxy device to lay perfectly flat on the table,
why not make it just slighlyl larger and add

00:04:29.479 --> 00:04:31.430
OIS.

00:04:31.430 --> 00:04:55.940
Now with these top 5 problems listed, I want
to say that I’m still very excited for this

00:04:55.940 --> 00:04:56.940
new iPad.

00:04:56.940 --> 00:05:17.970
The new design, face id, that 8 core CPU and
7 core graphics, and

00:05:17.970 --> 00:05:31.139
the much more powerful applications that are
being released is making Apple goal of iPads

00:05:31.139 --> 00:05:41.889
replacing PC’s much more possible for a
lot of people.

